          "period_solver": "GPU periods are grouped by exact row count and first use a batched Gram-spectrum certificate. Clearly well-conditioned designs with lambda_min(X'X)/lambda_max(X'X) > 1e-4 use a batched Gram solve; uncertified periods are not allowed to consume that candidate.",
